  "ownerInstruction": "I approve the research direction and authorize the next bounded editorial finalization step.\n\nAPPROVED:\n\n- the six promoted narration claims;\n- the documented qualifications;\n- the documented exclusions;\n- the source limitations;\n- Hook Option 2 as the selected hook:\n\n  “The cars move forward. But a traffic jam can move backward.”\n\n- the six-beat narrative structure;\n- the conceptual VisualPlan;\n- the central visual thesis:\n  cars move forward while the congestion pattern can propagate backward;\n- use of the 22-car circular-track experiment as controlled evidence;\n- the distinction between internally generated stop-and-go traffic and\n  congestion caused by external bottlenecks;\n- the requirement that experiment reconstructions / explanatory models be\n  disclosed appropriately;\n- the proposed caption direction.\n\nThen present the FINAL EXACT narration for owner approval.\n\nThis authorization is for EDITORIAL FINALIZATION ONLY.\n\nDo not fabricate a review timestamp that was not supplied; distinguish\ndecision-entry time according to repository conventions.",
